    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32736" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκποτάομαι</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκπορπ-έομαι</span></b> ,=<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκπέτομαι,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fly out</i> or <i>forth,</i>
			of snowflakes, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Διὸς ἐκποτέονται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					19.357
				</span></i>
			 ; of a ghost, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεδ᾽ ἀμαύρων νεκύων ἐκπεποτᾱμένα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sapph.
					68.4
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾷ τὰς φρένας
				ἐκπεπότασαι</span> ; <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				11.72
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				2.19
			</span></i>.</div>
